%% Sign-in and silent refresh. Claude rewrites this from the code via /update-diagrams.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Family member
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as API (AuthService)
  participant D as SQLite

  U->>W: email and password
  W->>A: POST /api/v1/auth/login
  A->>D: check password, lockout, active
  A->>D: store hashed refresh token
  A-->>W: 15-minute JWT, plus HttpOnly refresh cookie (7 days)
  Note over W: access token kept in memory only
  W->>A: API calls with Authorization: Bearer
  Note over W,A: before expiry or on a 401 (single-flight across tabs)
  W->>A: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh with the cookie
  A->>D: rotate the token (replaying an old one revokes the session)
  A-->>W: new JWT and new cookie
